{"version":1,"content":"<p>TVB花旦陳煒（煒哥）和姚子羚同樣是11月21日生日，日前二人與一班圈中好友相約飯局慶生，當中包括蔣祖曼、賴慰玲、黃嘉雯等。</p><p>陳煒今日（27日） 就在社交平台分享聚會的合照，可見現場氣氛相當熱鬧溫馨，眾人齊齊為兩位壽星女送上祝福。</p><p>&lt;br</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T06:43:54.741281+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T05:19:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T06:37:14.907875+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T06:37:14.907875+00:00","content_hash":"f939236cacdd5fb410b15875ff083bd28bb611047e893cdfe71b3d4a6e72c5f4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}